                "text": "Just wrapped up a town hall with folks in New Hampshire where I made clear I won\u2019t stop fighting until we lower Americans\u2019 skyrocketing health care costs. We are the most powerful and richest nation on earth no one should have to choose between their groceries and medicine. https://t.co/4pLneWMCdh",
